 abstract = {Summary <p>Power Query is designed to be the ultimate set&#x2010;it&#x2010;and&#x2010;forget&#x2010;it technology. This chapter briefly introduces the bones of Power Query. With Power Query, one can clean and merge datasets from a multitude of data sources. Once Power Query is connected to the data, the required changes can be made to get it ready for analysis. Power Query tracks every step with a point&#x2010;and&#x2010;click interface. The chapter focuses on some sample data. Power Query is started by clicking the Data tab on the ribbon. The leftmost side of the Data tab will contain Power Query. On the right side, Power Query keeps a list of steps. The steps involved in Power Query process are filtering rows, removing columns, find &amp; replace mechanism, and close &amp; load process. This will close out Power Query and load it to Excel.</p>},
